---
description: Prepare one packageAccessibleMedia evidence slice.
args: { goal: string; records: AccessibilityCheck[]; evidence: EvidenceItem[] }
returns: EvidenceSlice
---
Select a bounded evidence slice for the exact subject and task. Include supporting and contradictory versions, authority, and freshness. Record searched scope and missing decisive facts. Apply this stage's relevance rule: Assemble coordinated format-specific files with stable segment IDs and the correct source revision. Verify player or delivery compatibility, preserve reviewer notes, and update only affected segments when the underlying edit changes. Return source item IDs and evidence, not conclusions or a corpus-wide paraphrase.
